<title>USA: Mellon Bank trust files $500 mln stock offer.</title>
<headline>Mellon Bank trust files $500 mln stock offer.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mellon Capital II, a business trust formed by Mellon Bank Corp, filed a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission Monday for the offering of up to $500 million in series B capital securities.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the offering will be used to purchase junior subordinated debentures to be issued by Mellon Bank. The bank holding company will use the funds for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>No underwriters were listed in the filing.</p>
</text>
